{"function":"solve(payload)","spec":"Implement an idempotent event ledger. payload contains initial balances (known account ids), initial frozen account ids, and events in execution order. All amounts and thresholds are nonnegative integers; all referenced accounts exist. cancel targets non-cancel event ids. When cancel='global', collect all cancel targets first and skip all occurrences of those ids, including earlier events. When cancel='forward', process cancel positions in order and block only later target occurrences; never undo earlier effects. cancel never enters accepted. For dedup='first_seen', mark each uncancelled unseen non-cancel id seen BEFORE testing its condition, even if rejected. For dedup='first_applied', mark only after execution: a rejected id can execute on a later occurrence with different payload. Always ignore already seen ids. credit adds amount, including to frozen accounts only if credit_frozen=true. debit executes only on an unfrozen account with enough funds. transfer requires enough source funds and unfrozen source; destination must also be unfrozen iff transfer_requires_unfrozen_destination. freeze/thaw set/clear frozen; a no-op counts as applied iff count_noop_freeze=true. bonus tests CURRENT balance of if_account against threshold using >= for ge or > for gt; if true it acts as credit to account with the same frozen rule. Rejected operations do nothing. A no-op freeze/thaw rejected for counting still leaves the same frozen state. Return {'balances':{account:int},'frozen':sorted_account_ids,'accepted':[executed event ids in execution order]}. Every applied event, including allowed no-ops, enters accepted once. IMPORTANT: solve must not mutate payload, including any nested object; return fresh result objects.","rules":{"cancel":"global","dedup":"first_seen","credit_frozen":false,"transfer_requires_unfrozen_destination":true,"count_noop_freeze":false,"bonus_comparison":"gt"},"starter_source":"def solve(payload):
    balances = dict(payload['initial'])
    accepted = []
    for event in payload['events']:
        if event['op'] == 'credit':
            balances[event['account']] += event['amount']
            accepted.append(event['id'])
        elif event['op'] == 'debit':
            balances[event['account']] -= event['amount']
